From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Simon=20W=C3=BClker?= <simon.wuelker@arcor.de>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 18:19:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] script: Return list of matching fonts from FontFaceSet.load
 (backport of #47564)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`FontFaceSet.load` receives a CSS `font` shorthand and is supposed to
query matching faces in the set, wait for all of them to load and then
return a list of the corresponding `FontFace` objects. Currently we
instead wait for `document.fonts.ready` and return an empty list. This
change begins implementing the font query. Font matching is done in a
naive manner for now, we simply return all fonts with a matching
`font-family`. Its unclear to me how proper matching should be done, as
this needs to happen before the font data is available. Still, this is
progress.

Testing: New tests start to pass
Part of https://github.com/servo/servo/issues/21565

Fork note: backport of upstream a8d5fdaa915 (#47564), which landed a few
hours after base/2026-08-29. `fonts: Only load @font-face fonts that the
page uses` needs the font query: with lazy loading, `document.fonts.load()`
is what asks for a face that nothing on the page uses yet, and without this
commit it never finds one. The subject differs from upstream's only because
STACK.md cannot hold backticks.

Drop at the next sync: every later base contains a8d5fdaa915, so this commit
applies empty and becomes a `Superseded-by: a8d5fdaa915` placeholder (runbook
decision 3).

Validation: `./mach test-wpt --release --processes 1 css/css-font-loading css/css-fonts html/canvas/element/text html/canvas/offscreen/text` (947 tests) shows no unexpected result beyond those plain ohos-main already has on the host (font-variant-emoji-1 FAIL, font-variant-emoji-2 and matching/font-unicode-presented-as-emoji-outline PASS); upstream's new expectations for fontfaceset-load-var, fontfaceset-load-css-wide-keywords, font-face-range-order and font-face-style-normal hold. One run failed font-feature-settings-descriptor-01; five reruns pass on both this commit and ohos-main.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; clean `git cherry-pick -x` of upstream a8d5fdaa915, subject reworded for STACK.md, no code changes)
